---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { url } from '../../lib/urls';
---
<Layout title="The edit — No rules" description="The Afterglow editorial: worn leather, lived-in denim, and 90s-inspired styling. A little inspiration for your next favorite outfit." current="lookbook/">
  <section class="page-intro section"><p class="eyebrow">VOL. 02 / THE AFTERGLOW FIELD GUIDE</p><h1>CUT. PASTE.<br /><em>REPEAT.</em></h1><p class="lead">Grunge hearts. Skate-park souls. Take what you like. Make it your own.</p></section>
  <section id="off-duty" class="lookbook-story section"><div class="lookbook-image"><img src={url('images/zine/skate-editorial.webp')} width="1536" height="1024" alt="Adult skater mid-air in baggy denim and an oversized yellow tee" fetchpriority="high" /><span class="lookbook-number">01</span></div><div class="lookbook-copy" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">THE OFF-DUTY UNIFORM / SIDE A</p><h2>GO BIG.<br /><em>GET OUTSIDE.</em></h2><p>Big denim. A louder tee. Shoes you can actually live in. Borrow the ease of a skate-mag spread and take it wherever you’re going.</p><p class="styling-note">THE FORMULA / BAGGY DENIM + GRAPHIC TEE + GOING YOUR OWN WAY</p></div></section>
  <section id="in-the-details" class="lookbook-story section alternate"><div class="lookbook-image"><img src={url('images/zine/grunge-collage.webp')} width="1024" height="1536" alt="Layered grunge fashion collage with plaid, leather, roses, and combat boots" loading="lazy" /><span class="lookbook-number">02</span></div><div class="lookbook-copy" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">THE BEAUTIFUL MESS / SIDE B</p><h2>CLASH A<br /><em>LITTLE.</em></h2><p>Florals and plaid. Soft and scuffed. A little something borrowed from a decade you refuse to let go of. The combination is the point.</p><p class="styling-note">THE FORMULA / ONE SOFT THING + ONE LOUD THING + YOUR OWN INSTINCTS</p></div></section>
  <section class="section closing-note"><p>These editorial images set the mood; they aren't product listings.<br />For what’s available right now, head to the shop.</p><a class="button" href={url('shop/')}>Find your version ↗</a></section>
</Layout>
